  m_text: "Kingdom of Lemuria \u2013 Amidst civil unrest, a 21-mile-long train track
    determines the fate of convicted criminals. As the chosen conductor, you decide
    who lives and who dies.\n\nCollect inheritance from the fallen, but beware: killing
    high-status targets raises your guilt, and you might end up on the tracks yourself.\n\nW/S
    \u2013 Start/Stop\nA/D \u2013 Left/Right\n1/2/3 \u2013 Camera Zoom"
